  m_text: "Jamshedpur (Jharkhand) is India\u2019s first and largest private steel
    plant by Tata Steel. The Vijayanagar Plant (Karnataka) has modern steel complex
    operated by JSW Steel. Bhadravati (Karnataka) is one of India\u2019s oldest steel
    plants using hydroelectric power."
